a,\\mathfrak b,\\mathfrak d\">\\(\\mathfrak a,\\mathfrak b,\\mathfrak d\\)</span> are cardinal numbers.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}invariants\\text{-}ad}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(\\mathcal A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}invariants\\text{-}ad}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(\\mathcal A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}invariants\\text{-}a}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak a=\n\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|:\n\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap X)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}invariants\\text{-}a}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak a=\n\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|:\n\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap X)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}invariants\\text{-}unbounded}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Unbounded}_\\omega(F)\n\\leftrightarrow\nF\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\omega\\land\n\\neg\\exists g\\in{}^\\omega\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in F\\;(f\\leq^*g).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\