ark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>These are cardinal characteristics of the continuum, not real-valued cardinals.</li>\n<li>The non-strict eventual order <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq^*\">\\(\\leq^*\\)</span> is the standard order used in the definitions of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak b\">\\(\\mathfrak b\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak d\">\\(\\mathfrak d\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Blass, Combinatorial Cardinal Characteristics of the Continuum</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F,D\\subseteq{}^\\omega\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f\\leq^*g\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{n\\in\\omega:f(n)>g(n)\\})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S,\\mathrm{Unbounded}_\\omega,\\mathrm{Dominating}_\\omega:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak a,\\mathfrak b,\\mathfrak d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}invariants\\text{-}ad}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(\\mathcal A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal A\\subseteq[\\omega]^\\omega\\land\n\\forall A,B\\in\\mathcal A\\;(A\\neq B\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap B)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}invariants\\text{-}a}\\vdash\n\\mathfrak a=\n\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|:\n\\mathrm{AlmostDisjoint}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land\n\\forall X\\in[\\omega]^\\omega\\;\\exists A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\n\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A\\cap X)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\